{
  "$comment": [
    "Permission profile for the unattended solo-sweep lane (scripts/solo-sweep).",
    "Nobody is watching a run of this lane, so it is scoped to READ upstream and",
    "WRITE ONLY local files + bd notes. It may not publish, merge, close, or commit.",
    "The wrapper — not the agent — makes the commit and the push.",
    "This file is only loaded via `claude --settings`; it is inert in normal sessions.",
    "Deny rules are the last line of defence, not the first: the strongest rail is a",
    "read-only GH_TOKEN (see SOLO_SWEEP_GH_TOKEN_FILE in scripts/solo-sweep)."
  ],
